      "message": "Yup.  The spec dictates that \"The Number of Data Objects field in the Message Header Shall be set to 1 or 2 since the Attention Command Shall\nNot contain more than 1 VDO.\".  We could pad it just in case the spec changes, but I\u0027m not certain the odds for that. \n\nIt\u0027s on the same host command, but I started it as a separate event.  I\u0027m open to suggestions though if you\u0027d prefer it shares the `PD_STATUS_EVENT_VDM_REQ_REPLY` event.\n\nThe Attention queue portion of this CL stack needs some more changes to get the unit testing totally ready, FYI",
